    "description" : "Cyber Threat Intelligence Platform read API. M1 exposes anonymous read access to public TLP:CLEAR intelligence with cursor pagination; authentication, RBAC and write endpoints arrive in M2. All errors share a single ErrorResponse shape with a log-correlated traceId (see docs/spec/09-api.md §9.4).",
    "title" : "CTIP API",
    "version" : "v1"
  },
